---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Puppy Starter Guide collects and uses data from site visitors."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500">Last updated: September 1, 2026</p>
    <div class="prose prose-stone mt-6 max-w-none">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        Puppy Starter Guide uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand how visitors use this
        site — page views, general location by country, device type and referral source. This
        analytics method does not use cookies and does not track you across other websites.
      </p>
      <p>
        We also record anonymous, aggregate interaction events for this site's free tools (for
        example, when a schedule is generated) so we can understand which features are useful.
        These events do not include any personal information.
      </p>

      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>
        Some articles contain affiliate links. When you click one, the destination site may set
        its own cookies or tracking parameters in accordance with its own privacy policy. See our
        <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> for more detail.
      </p>

      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell or share personal data with third parties for advertising purposes. We do
        not currently collect email addresses, account information, or any personally
        identifiable information through this site.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this privacy policy, please reach out through the contact
        details on our <a href="/about/">About</a> page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
